&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;The Company&amp;#8217;s investments in government securities were classified as held to maturity as of December 31, 2025 and 2024 and recorded at amortized cost due to the Company&amp;#8217;s positive intent and ability to hold them until maturity. The Company&amp;#8217;s government securities had contractual maturities of less than one year at December 31, 2025 and 2024.&lt;/p&gt;
