&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 7.2pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 1pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '(%0)'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'upperLetter'; -aw-list-number-values: '1'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 15.47pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;(A)&lt;font style="width: 15.47pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;Due February 1, 2027; principal and interest are payable quarterly based on a 25-year amortization. Payments commenced on May 1, 2007. The interest rate adjusts daily based on SOFR plus 0.95%. At December 31, 2025 and 2024, the interest rate was 4.82% and 5.26%, respectively. The note is secured by a first mortgage on the Company&amp;#8217;s operation facility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '(%0)'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'upperLetter'; -aw-list-number-values: '2'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 15.47pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;(B)&lt;font style="width: 15.47pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;Due December 30, 2042; principal and interest are payable quarterly based on a 32-year amortization. Principal payments commenced on March 30, 2013. The interest rate is fixed at 4.82%. The notes are unsecured.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '(%0)'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'upperLetter'; -aw-list-number-values: '3'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 14.92pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;(C)&lt;font style="width: 14.92pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;Due December 30, 2025; principal and interest were payable quarterly based on an 11 year and 9 months amortization. Principal payments commenced on March 30, 2024. The interest rate was fixed at 3.80%. The notes were unsecured.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '(%0)'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'upperLetter'; -aw-list-number-values: '4'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 14.92pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;(D)&lt;font style="width: 14.92pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;Due March 31, 2025; principal and interest were payable quarterly based on a four-year amortization. Payments commenced on June 30, 2021. The interest rate was fixed at 2.875%. The note was unsecured.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '(%0)'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'upperLetter'; -aw-list-number-values: '5'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 15.47pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;(E)&lt;font style="width: 15.47pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;Due December 15, 2028; principal and interest are payable semi-annually based on a seven-year amortization. Principal payments commence on December 15, 2026. The interest rate is fixed at 2.210%. The notes are unsecured.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; -aw-import: list-item; -aw-list-level-number: 0; -aw-list-number-format: '(%0)'; -aw-list-number-styles: 'upperLetter'; -aw-list-number-values: '6'; -aw-list-padding-sml: 16.03pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;(F)&lt;font style="width: 16.03pt; font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; display: inline-block; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;Due March 31, 2030; principal and interest are payable quarterly based on an five-year amortization. Payments commenced on June 30, 2025. The interest rate is fixed at 5.885%. The notes are unsecured.&lt;/p&gt;
