&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;For the defined benefit pension plan there are $482 net gains, $0 prior service cost, and $0 net obligation to be amortized from members&amp;#8217; deficit into net periodic benefit cost over the next fiscal year. For the postretirement healthcare plan there are $117 net gains, $0 prior service cost, and $0 net obligation to be amortized from members&amp;#8217; deficit into net periodic benefit cost over the next fiscal year.&lt;/p&gt;
