              <xhtml:td style="width: 50%; text-align: right; border-bottom: 2.8pt double #000000; height: 22px;">
                <xhtml:strong>(24,030,076)</xhtml:strong>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 22px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 50%; height: 22px;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 50%; height: 22px;">
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 41px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 50%; height: 41px;">*Includes miscellaneous current and accrued assets (174) and a portion of the change in other special funds (128) related to the 457(b) plan assets.</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 50%; height: 41px;">
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value6" xlink:to="footnote6" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="6" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote7" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Utility Plant (101-105, 114) total of $348,249,846 includes an operating lease/right of use (ROU) asset valued at $649,343. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases, the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating lease is recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the liability is in account 227.0 and the current portion of the liability is in account 243.0.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value7" xlink:to="footnote7" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="7" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote8" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
