      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The $546,167 represents an operating lease/right of use (ROU) asset. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating lease asset is recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the liability is in account 227.0 and the current portion of the liability is in account 243.0.</xhtml:p>
