            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 50%; height: 20px;">*The $546,167 represents an operating lease/right of use (ROU) asset. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating lease asset is recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the related liability is in account 227.0 while the current portion is in account 243.0.</xhtml:td>
